# catalog/lane-run-inputs.d/merge-conductor.ro — what one
# `bin/merge-conductor-pr.sh $p <owner/repo>#<n> <head40>` run (MC_ONLY_PR,
# MC_ON_MACHINE=1) reads and never writes back. The snapshot is
# merge-conductor.rw plus these lines. The file:line after each entry is where
# the run reads it. tests/lane-run-inputs-mc-manifest.bh-6889-test.sh traces a
# run (T1a) and checks that the snapshot alone gives the hub's outcome (T1c).
# An entry the fixture does not reach says so.
#
# NOT IN THE SNAPSHOT. Repo-tracked files the machine pulls with main
# (config/*, catalog/*, bin/*: catalog/lead-protected-paths.seed.tsv is read,
# bin/lib/lead-authority.sh). Secrets: env/* (env/global.env is read). Caches
# the machine fills from the jobs worker itself: state/settings-cache.json,
# state/flags-cache/*, state/box-name, state/gh-*, state/lead-authority/*.
# The rebase and deploy-verify job dirs (state/merge-conductor/rebase|
# deploy-verify): a machine run defers each spawn before it reads a job file
# (bin/lib/mc/rebase.sh:3393, :3509), and the trace shows no read. The
# re-review job dir is carried by merge-conductor.rw since BH-7674: a machine
# run puts an RR-* pool row and reads its verdict on the next tick. state/batch-resolve/*: a keyed tick never reaches the batch
# spawn (bin/merge-conductor.sh:3295, MC_ONLY_KEYS). state/merge-sweep-done.txt:
# only conductor_settle reads it (bin/lib/mc/settle.sh:560 via :778), and a
# machine run defers the settle first (:756).
#
# The record files read only:
#   RESULT                  mc_record_for globs builds/*-*/RESULT, bin/lib/mc/classify.sh:488
#   review.md               bin/lib/mc/classify.sh:545
#   headbound-outcome       bin/lib/mc/classify.sh:547 (not reached by the fixture)
#   pipeline.log            bin/lib/mc/classify.sh:572
#   ticket-meta.json        bin/lib/mc/train.sh:636 (not reached by the fixture)
#   planned-files.txt       bin/lib/mc/train.sh:704 (not reached by the fixture)
# A token name of its own: a second <record file> would replace the .rw one.
@token <read file> RESULT review.md headbound-outcome pipeline.log ticket-meta.json planned-files.txt
# This project's records only; the hub's glob also opens other projects' RESULT.
builds/$p-<KEY>-*/<read file>
builds/pool-$p-<KEY>-*/<read file>
builds/fly-$p-<KEY>-*/<read file>
# bin/lib/mc/train.sh:700-701 (not reached by the fixture)
plans/$p-<KEY>/planned-files.txt
# bin/merge-conductor.sh:342, bin/lib/mc/classify.sh:993 (merge-conductor-actions),
# bin/lib/main-red-gate.sh:86,129 (MAIN_RED_FREEZE flags/main-red-$p), pause flags
flags/*
# bin/merge-conductor.sh:130, bin/merge-conductor-pr.sh:41,59
fleet.conf
# bin/lib/pause.sh:67 (the pauses cache; not reached by the fixture)
state/pauses.json
# bin/lib/mc/locks.sh:828 (not reached by the fixture)
state/claude-auth-down.txt
# bin/lib/mc/log.sh:93 (not reached by the fixture)
state/blocked-resolver/.saturated
# bin/merge-conductor.sh:2657 (bin/lib/mc/locks.sh:316 writes it on a full tick
# only; not reached by the fixture)
state/merge-conductor/tick-$p.json
# bin/merge-conductor.sh:734, bin/lib/mc/queue.sh:26,38-40 (bin/batch-resolve.sh
# writes it; not reached by the fixture)
state/merge-conductor/batch-hold/$repokey_*
# bin/merge-conductor.sh:756, bin/lib/mc/rebase.sh:168-169 (not reached by the fixture)
state/contested/$p/*
